ty runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, and in 2025 it came in at 67% while November to December came in at 49%. The open year started low, with January to February 2026 at 45% of normal and February to March 2026 at 50% on the middle of the grids. Grid 15749 had its driest year in 2005 at 58%.</p>"}
